<section id="A5.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.2.2 </span>Level 2: Time-Limited Targets</h4>

<div id="A5.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The second level introduces time pressure by making targets disappear after a fixed duration, requiring faster decision-making from RL agents.</p>
</div>
