<div id="A5.SS2.SSS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.SSS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The consistent register mapping across all three levels enables direct comparison of agent performance and facilitates automated curriculum progression. Register V[2] consistently stores the score for reward calculation, while V[3] serves as the binary termination flag. The five-action control scheme (WASD movement plus shoot) provides sufficient complexity for interesting policies while remaining tractable for systematic analysis.</p>
